+-----------------------+-------------------------------+----------------------------------------+
| Method Syntax         | Category                      | Operation (Short)                      |
+-----------------------+-------------------------------+----------------------------------------+
| **ArrayDeque as Queue** (FIFO)                                                                 |
+-----------------------+-------------------------------+----------------------------------------+
| add(E e)              | Queue: Insert                 | Add at tail; throws on failure         |
| offer(E e)            | Queue: Insert                 | Add at tail; returns false on failure  |
| remove()              | Queue: Remove                 | Remove & return head; throws if empty  |
| poll()                | Queue: Remove                 | Remove & return head; returns null     |
| element()             | Queue: Peek                   | View head; throws if empty             |
| peek()                | Queue: Peek                   | View head; returns null if empty       |
+-----------------------+-------------------------------+----------------------------------------+
| **ArrayDeque as Stack** (LIFO)                                                                 |
+-----------------------+-------------------------------+----------------------------------------+
| push(E e)             | Stack: Push                   | Push at front (same as addFirst)       |
| pop()                 | Stack: Pop                    | Pop head (same as removeFirst); throws |
+-----------------------+-------------------------------+----------------------------------------+
| **ArrayDeque as Deque** (Double-Ended: front & tail)        |
+-----------------------+-------------------------------+----------------------------------------+
| addFirst(E e)         | Deque: Insert at Front        | Add at front; throws on failure        |
| addLast(E e)          | Deque: Insert at Tail         | Add at tail; throws on failure         |
| offerFirst(E e)       | Deque: Insert at Front        | Add at front; returns false on failure |
| offerLast(E e)        | Deque: Insert at Tail         | Add at tail; returns false on failure  |
| removeFirst()         | Deque: Remove from Front      | Remove & return head; throws if empty  |
| removeLast()          | Deque: Remove from Tail       | Remove & return tail; throws if empty  |
| pollFirst()           | Deque: Remove from Front      | Remove & return head; returns null     |
| pollLast()            | Deque: Remove from Tail       | Remove & return tail; returns null     |
| peekFirst()           | Deque: Peek at Front          | View head; returns null if empty       |
| peekLast()            | Deque: Peek at Tail           | View tail; returns null if empty       |
| getFirst()            | Deque: Peek at Front          | View head; throws if empty             |
| getLast()             | Deque: Peek at Tail           | View tail; throws if empty             |
+-----------------------+-------------------------------+----------------------------------------+
| **Common / Utility Methods**                                                                   |
+-----------------------+-------------------------------+----------------------------------------+
| size()                | Query                         | Return number of elements              |
| isEmpty()             | Query                         | Return true if empty                   |
| contains(Object o)    | Query                         | Return true if contains element        |
| clear()               | Modify                        | Remove all elements                    |
| iterator()            | Iterate                       | Forward iterator (head → tail)         |
| descendingIterator()  | Iterate                       | Backward iterator (tail → head)        |
| toArray()             | Convert                       | Return Object[] with all elements      |
| toArray(T[] a)        | Convert                       | Return typed array with all elements   |
+-----------------------+-------------------------------+----------------------------------------+

